Input Traffic → Feature Embedding → State-Space Backbone → BiGRU Refinement → TAAG → Classification


### Key Components

| Component | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| **Mamba Backbone** | Input-dependent selective SSM with linear complexity |
| **BiGRU Refinement** | Bidirectional GRU for local pattern recovery |
| **TAAG** | Traffic-aware gating using Mamba context |
| **S-SSM** | Structured SSM with DPLR + HiPPO initialization |

## Installation

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/hss-rnet.git
cd hss-rnet

# Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate  # Linux/Mac
# venv\Scripts\activate   # Windows

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
pip install -e .
